{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00775",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.25,
      "end_seconds": 14.71,
      "duration_seconds": 12.46,
      "text": "Hi! Right, lupus review. I think I'm doing okay, but you tell me. I've also got a rash on my cheeks that's come back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.5,
      "end_seconds": 26.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "Good to see you. Let's start with the rash. When did it come back?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.15,
      "end_seconds": 39.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "About two weeks ago. Across my cheeks and nose, a butterfly thing. It's worse in the sun."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.21,
      "end_seconds": 45.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Any joint pains? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.64,
      "end_seconds": 55.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "A bit, in my hands, in the mornings. Nothing too bad. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.47,
      "end_seconds": 61.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Let's check what you're taking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.99,
      "end_seconds": 77.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.85,
      "text": "Hydroxychloroquine, 200 mg twice a day. Prednisolone, 5 mg, once a day. And a calcium and vitamin D tablet, once a day, for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.51,
      "end_seconds": 88.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Good, that matches. Any fever, or mouth ulcers, or chest pain when you breathe in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.35,
      "end_seconds": 94.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.18,
      "end_seconds": 102.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "And what do you do for work, are you outdoors?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.47,
      "end_seconds": 109.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "I'm a postwoman, so yes, outdoors most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.47,
      "end_seconds": 117.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "That could well be the sun triggering the rash. Let me look. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.89,
      "end_seconds": 137.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.53,
      "end_seconds": 154.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "text": "There's a pink, slightly raised rash across both cheeks and the bridge of your nose, and the skin elsewhere on the face is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.91,
      "end_seconds": 161.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Is it a flare? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.04,
      "end_seconds": 174.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.74,
      "text": "With the sun-sensitive rash and a bit of morning hand stiffness, I'd say this is a mild flare of your lupus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.03,
      "end_seconds": 180.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Do I need more tablets? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.22,
      "end_seconds": 192.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "Not today. Your current treatment is covering you, and I'd rather get the sun protection right first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.47,
      "end_seconds": 198.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I wear a hat. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.93,
      "end_seconds": 214.48,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "A hat's good, but you need a high-factor sun cream, factor 50, on your face, every day, even when it's cloudy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.54,
      "end_seconds": 220.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Every day? Even in winter? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.01,
      "end_seconds": 234.01,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "Yes, because UV gets through cloud. And long sleeves on your arms when you're on your round. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.47,
      "end_seconds": 242.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Right. And what about my eyes, the hydroxychloroquine? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.5,
      "end_seconds": 253.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "You should have your yearly eye check, so I'll make sure that's booked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.04,
      "end_seconds": 259.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Good, I was going to ask. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.25,
      "end_seconds": 275.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "If the rash spreads, you get a fever, mouth ulcers, swollen ankles, or your urine goes frothy or dark, ring me and come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.17,
      "end_seconds": 282.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Right. I'll watch for those. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.28,
      "end_seconds": 289.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Keep taking everything as you are. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.2,
      "end_seconds": 298.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Thanks, doctor, it's always good to talk it through. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.98,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Take care, and mind the sun. ~"
    }
  ]
}
